OL,3,GNEWSA'All of British prehistory is
OL,4,Aplayed out here'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's a brick pit, a chip factory,
OL,7,Fyou're on the edge of the industrial
OL,8,Festate of Peterborough and yet the
OL,9,Fquality and quantity of archaeology in
OL,10,Fthat landscape is astonishing," says
OL,11,FMark Knight.
OL,13,FHe has been directing the excavations
OL,14,Fat Must Farm, near Whittlesey,
OL,15,FCambridgeshire, since 2004, saying "the
OL,16,Fdeeper we go, the earlier we get".
OL,18,FThe quarry is most famous for the
OL,19,Fdiscovery of the "best-preserved Bronze
OL,20,FAge dwellings ever found", dating back
OL,21,F3,000 years and dubbed Britain's
OL,22,FPompeii.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
